/**
 * Connects a KeyedPlain client. It waits up to `options.timeout` milliseconds (default 5000) for the
 * host Bridge to connect, then rejects with a `timeout` BridgeError. `options.signal` abandons the connection.
 * A `using` declaration disposes the client where the engine has `Symbol.dispose`.
